This project's engine/ directory is a derivative of ats-screener
(https://github.com/sunnypatell/ats-screener), used and modified under the
MIT License below. The original project's LLM-based features (llm/*, the
web UI, Firebase/LDAP auth, hosted API routes) were removed entirely; only
the deterministic, rule-based parser + scorer was kept, then localized for
French-language resumes (section headers, dates, degree vocabulary, action
verbs, accent folding — see comments marked "FR localization" throughout
engine/ for the specific changes and why each was made).

